5-31","ACN.d.revenue.2026-06-01.2026-08-31","ACN.d.opinc.2025-09-01.2025-11-30","ACN.d.opinc.2025-12-01.2026-02-28","ACN.d.opinc.2026-03-01.2026-05-31","ACN.d.opinc.2026-06-01.2026-08-31","ACN.d.netinc.2025-09-01.2025-11-30","ACN.d.netinc.2025-12-01.2026-02-28","ACN.d.netinc.2026-03-01.2026-05-31","ACN.d.netinc.2026-06-01.2026-08-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $11.6 billion: operating cash flow of $12.4 billion less capital spending of $743 million (computed from eight filed figures).","cites":["ACN.d.ocf.2025-09-01.2025-11-30","ACN.d.ocf.2025-09-01.2026-02-28","ACN.d.ocf.2025-09-01.2026-05-31","ACN.d.ocf.2025-09-01.2026-08-31","ACN.d.capex.2025-09-01.2025-11-30","ACN.d.capex.2025-09-01.2026-02-28","ACN.d.capex.2025-09-01.2026-05-31","ACN.d.capex.2025-09-01.2026-08-31"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2025-12-12 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2025 as $29.6 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $16.6 million.","cites":["ACN.pay.peoTotal.2025","ACN.pay.peoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $6.5 million in total and $4.2 million actually paid.","cites":["ACN.pay.neoTotal.2025","ACN.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $37 billion at the end of FY2026, against $34 billion a year earlier. That is 49.9% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["ACN.rpo.2026","ACN.rpo.2025","ACN.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $6.3 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged DeferredRevenueCurrent), against $6.1 billion a year earlier.","cites":["ACN.deferred.2026","ACN.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 814,000 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $91,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["ACN.q.employees","ACN.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $12.8 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $6.3 million in short-term investments, and $10.1 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtAndCapitalLeaseObligations + DebtCurrent). Cash and short-term investments exceeded that debt by $2.7 billion (computed from four filed figures).","cites":["ACN.cash.2026","ACN.sti.2026","ACN.debtLong.2026","ACN.debtCurrent.2026"]}]},"fin":{"ACN":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":243,"read":243,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["Egawa Atsushi","Co-CEO Asia Pacific"],["Price Paula A","Director"],["Sweet Julie Spellman","Chair and CEO, director"],["Burgum Melissa A","Chief Accounting Officer"],["Sekido Ryoji","Co-CEO Asia Pacific"],["Hogan Catherine Kiernan","Chief Operating Officer"],["Clifford Katherine Lee","Chief Leadership & HR Officer"],["Unruch Joel","General Counsel/Corp Secretary"],["Walsh John F","CEO-The Americas"],["Sharma Manish","Chief Strategy & Services Ofcr"],["Macchi Mauro","Chief Executive Officer-EMEA"]],"rows":[["S",0,10000,2700000,"2026-11-05","2026-11-05","0002030841-26-000006","2026-11-05",1],["P",1,800,199847.76,"2026-10-26","2026-10-26","0001369240-26-000014","2026-10-28",0],["P",2,12200,3001041.24,"2026-10-26","2026-10-26","0001487630-26-000022","2026-10-28",0],["S",3,811,202750,"2026-10-22","2026-10-22","0001455134-26-000023","2026-10-22",1],["S",4,5844,1430826.45,"2026-10-22","2026-10-22","0002030833-26-000004","2026-10-22",0],["S",5,700,149965.34,"2026-10-12","2026-10-12","0002080406-26-000018","2026-10-13",1],["S",5,1320,264000,"2026-10-08","2026-10-08","0002080406-26-000017","2026-10-09",1],["S",6,68,11966.3,"2026-08-14","2026-08-14","0002080407-26-000017","2026-08-17",0],["S",7,10498,1710918.89,"2026-07-30","20